          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "調整在飽和度上影響的範圍。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How far the blur softens, in pixels": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "模糊柔化的范围（像素）"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "模糊柔化的範圍（像素）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How much of each pixel's error spreads to its neighbors. Less gives flatter areas": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每个像素的误差扩散到相邻像素的程度。数值越小，区域越平坦"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每個像素的誤差擴散到相鄰像素的程度。數值越小，區域越平坦"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How much of the profile distortion correction is applied.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "应用配置文件扭曲校正的程度。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "套用描述檔扭曲校正的程度。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How much of the profile vignetting correction is applied.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "应用配置文件晕影校正的程度。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "套用描述檔暈影校正的程度。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How much the curve also changes color strength. Zero matches Photoshop; lower keeps it to brightness, higher adds more color.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "曲线同时改变颜色强度的程度。0 与 Photoshop 一致；更低则只影响亮度，更高则增加更多颜色。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "曲線同時改變顏色強度的程度。0 與 Photoshop 一致；更低則只影響亮度，更高則增加更多顏色。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
