    "That selection is too detailed to outline. Try a different Tolerance, or turn on Contiguous.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "该选区过于细碎，无法生成轮廓。请尝试其他容差，或打开“连续”。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "該選取範圍過於細碎，無法生成輪廓。請嘗試其他容許度，或開啟「連續」。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That shape is too large. A shape can cover up to %lld megapixels.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "形状太大。形状最多可覆盖 %lld 百万像素。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "形狀太大。形狀最多可覆蓋 %lld 百萬像素。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That text box exceeds the %@-pixel or %lld-megapixel limit.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "该文本框超过了 %1$@ 像素或 %2$lld 百万像素的限制。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "該文字框超過了 %1$@ 像素或 %2$lld 百萬像素的限制。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The 2012 response. Calibration reaches most of the strength used by Version 6.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "2012 年的响应。校准可达到版本 6 的大部分强度。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "2012 年的回應。校準可達到版本 6 的大部分強度。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Photoshop file could not be read. It may be damaged or incomplete.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无法读取该 Photoshop 文件。它可能已损坏或不完整。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "無法讀取該 Photoshop 檔案。它可能已損壞或不完整。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The brush trails the pointer on a string this long, so a shaky hand still draws a smooth line": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "画笔以此长度的“牵引线”跟随指针，即使手抖也能画出平滑的线条"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "筆刷以此長度的「牽引線」跟隨指標，即使手抖也能畫出平滑的線條"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The canvas could not be rendered. Try a smaller canvas.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无法渲染画布。请尝试更小的画布。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "無法渲染版面。請嘗試更小的版面。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The characters to draw with, in any order: each spot gets the one whose ink best matches its tone": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "用于绘制的字符，顺序不限：每个位置会使用墨量最接近其色调的字符"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "用於繪製的字元，順序不限：每個位置會使用墨量最接近其色調的字元"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The copied layers exceed this project’s %lld-megapixel limit.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "拷贝的图层超过了此项目 %lld 百万像素的限制。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
